  * * *
  
  ## Which Should You Use?
  
  - **Want to try everything?** Start with [WaveSpeedAI](https://wavespeed.ai/video-generator) — all major models, one account
  - **Need daily free clips?** Kling has the most generous recurring free tier
  - **Need creative effects?** Pika’s crush/melt/inflate are unique
  - **Need physics realism?** Sora through ChatGPT
  - **Have a GPU?** Run WAN or LTX locally for unlimited free generation
  
  For production work, [WaveSpeedAI’s video generator](https://wavespeed.ai/video-generator) gives you the flexibility to pick the best model per project — WAN 2.7 for flexible controls, Sora 2 for physics, Veo 3.1 Fast for cinematic quality, Kling for smooth motion — all from one API.
  
