  ## Frequently Asked Questions
  
  ### Is Sora 2 still free in 2026?
  
  No. OpenAI removed the free tier on January 10, 2026. Sora 2 now requires a ChatGPT Plus subscription at $20 per month or ChatGPT Pro at $200 per month. The Plus plan includes 1,000 monthly credits with watermarked output at 720p maximum. The Pro plan offers 10,000 credits, 1080p resolution, and no watermarks.
  
  ### What is the best free Sora 2 alternative?
  
  PixVerse V5 offers the most generous free tier with 60 daily credits, though output includes watermarks. Hedra provides limited free generations with watermarks. For technical users, the open-source Wan 2.6 is completely free but requires GPU hardware and command-line setup. See our full [AI video generator comparison](https://www.hedra.com/blog/best-ai-video-generators) for a deeper breakdown of free tiers across all major platforms.
  
  ### Can any alternative match Sora 2's video quality?
  
  Google Veo 3.1 and Runway Gen-4.5 both produce output that rivals Sora 2 in visual fidelity. Veo 3.1 leads in synchronized audio generation, while Runway excels in creative control and editing precision. Kling 3.0 offers the strongest motion quality at a budget price point starting at $6.99 per month. For [image-to-video](https://www.hedra.com/uses/image-to-video-ai) workflows specifically, results depend heavily on source image quality.
  
  ### Which Sora 2 alternative is best for business marketing?
  
  For business marketing that requires brand consistency, on-brand templates, and multi-format output, Hedra and Synthesia are the strongest options. Hedra combines multiple video models with brand kit integration and an [agent-driven workflow](https://www.hedra.com/blog/introducing-hedra-ai-agent). Its built-in [AI image generator](https://www.hedra.com/uses/ai-image-generator) also lets teams create source assets without leaving the platform. Synthesia specializes in [AI talking avatar](https://www.hedra.com/uses/ai-talking-avatar) presentations for training, explainers, and corporate communication.
  
  ### Is it worth paying $200 per month for Sora 2 Pro?
  
  For most creators, no. The $200 per month ChatGPT Pro subscription yields approximately 12 to 50 high-quality videos depending on resolution and length. Multi-model platforms and standalone alternatives provide comparable quality at [$15 to $75 per month](https://www.hedra.com/pricing) with greater flexibility and fewer restrictions.
  
  ### Can I access Sora 2 through other platforms?
  
  Yes. Several platforms integrate Sora 2 as one of multiple available models. [Hedra](https://www.hedra.com/), InVideo AI, and Kapwing all offer Sora 2 access alongside other video engines, often at lower effective costs than a direct ChatGPT subscription. Hedra also includes additional creative tools like [face swap](https://www.hedra.com/uses/face-swap) and [AI image generation](https://www.hedra.com/uses/ai-image-generator) in the same workspace.
  
  * * *
  
  ## Key Takeaways
  
  - **OpenAI removed Sora 2's free tier in January 2026.** Access now starts at $20 per month with significant limitations on resolution, duration, and output volume.
  
  - **The best Sora 2 alternative depends on what you need:** Kling 3.0 for motion quality at budget pricing, Veo 3.1 for native audio, Runway Gen-4.5 for creative control, and Hedra for multi-model workflows with brand consistency.
  
  - **Multi-model platforms are replacing single-tool subscriptions** because no single AI video model excels at everything. Choosing the right engine for each project produces better results than committing to one.
  
  - **For businesses creating content at scale,** platforms with brand kit integration and [agent-driven workflows](https://www.hedra.com/models/ai-agent) eliminate the biggest bottleneck: going from idea to finished, on-brand content without switching tools.
  
  - **Professional AI video creation is more accessible than ever.** Tools that required significant production budgets just a few years ago now cost $15 to $75 per month, making high-quality video creation practical for solo creators and small businesses alike. If you are new to the space, our guide on [how to make AI video](https://www.hedra.com/blog/how-to-make-ai-video) walks through the basics.
  
  
