  ### Why we like Dream Machine: Most cinematic
  
  If you're a creator with a flair for the cinematic, you're going to love making videos with Dream Machine.
  
  What really stands out is that you don't need precise details for motion areas, Dream Machine still manages to capture motion concepts effectively. It follows the laws of physics, ensuring that every shot feels grounded and realistic. Plus, it’s super fast! As their website mentions, Dream Machine can currently produce 120 frames in 120 seconds, which is not too shabby to say the least.
  
